   'deep',
   '{"summary":"Validate redirect targets server-side with a single canonical next parameter and an allow-list of same-origin paths.","steps":["Reject protocol-relative URLs (//evil.com) and off-origin hosts in redirect handlers.","Parse only the last (or only) next= parameter server-side — never trust client-side validation alone.","Use signed redirect tokens instead of raw URL parameters after login."]}'::jsonb,
